---
import Layout from '../../../components/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout title="Yearly Cycles - Numero Girija">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href={`${base}learn/`}>Learning Portal</a> / <a href={`${base}learn/advanced/`}>Advanced</a> / Yearly Cycles
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h1 class="section-title">🔄 The 9-Year Numerological Cycle</h1>

        <div class="intro">
            <p>Life moves in 9-year cycles. Each year has a specific energy that influences your experiences, opportunities, and challenges. Understanding your Personal Year helps you align actions with cosmic timing for maximum success.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="cycle-overview">
            <h2>The Complete Cycle</h2>
            <div class="cycle-diagram">
                <div class="cycle-phase building">
                    <h4>Years 1-3: Building Phase</h4>
                    <p>New beginnings, expansion, creativity - plant seeds for the future</p>
                </div>
                <div class="cycle-phase stability">
                    <h4>Years 4-6: Stability Phase</h4>
                    <p>Hard work, love, responsibility - nurture what you've built</p>
                </div>
                <div class="cycle-phase completion">
                    <h4>Years 7-9: Completion Phase</h4>
                    <p>Reflection, transformation, release - harvest and prepare for new cycle</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="years-detail">
            <h2>Detailed Year-by-Year Guide</h2>

            <div class="year-card year1">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">1</span>
                    <h3>New Beginnings</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Fresh start, independence, leadership, ambition</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Starting new projects, career changes, moving, new relationships</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Procrastination, following others, playing it safe</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I am a creator of my destiny"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year2">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">2</span>
                    <h3>Partnerships & Patience</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Cooperation, diplomacy, relationships, balance</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Building partnerships, marriage, teamwork, details</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Forcing issues, impatience, isolation, conflicts</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I cooperate and attract the right partnerships"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year3">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">3</span>
                    <h3>Creativity & Expression</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Self-expression, creativity, socializing, optimism</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Creative projects, networking, travel, learning new skills</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Scattered energy, over-committing, superficiality</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I express myself authentically"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year4">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">4</span>
                    <h3>Hard Work & Foundation</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Discipline, structure, organization, building</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Consolidation, property purchase, health routines, savings</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Laziness, resistance to routine, get-rich-quick schemes</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I build strong foundations"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year5">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">5</span>
                    <h3>Change & Freedom</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Freedom, adventure, unexpected changes, variety</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Travel, relocation, career pivots, trying new things</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Recklessness, gambling, burning bridges, instability</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I embrace change with grace"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year6">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">6</span>
                    <h3>Love & Responsibility</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Family, home, service, healing, marriage</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Marriage, home improvement, caregiving, beautification</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Being a doormat, neglecting self, family drama</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I give and receive love freely"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year7">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">7</span>
                    <h3>Spirituality & Introspection</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Inner work, rest, study, spiritual growth, analysis</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Education, meditation, research, healing, alone time</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Major business launches, overspending, superficial relationships</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I trust my inner wisdom"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year8">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">8</span>
                    <h3>Power & Abundance</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Material success, recognition, authority, karma</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Business expansion, investments, promotions, leadership</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Greed, manipulation, ego, unethical practices</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I attract abundance ethically"</p>
            </div>

            <div class="year-card year9">
                <div class="year-header">
                    <span class="year-num">9</span>
                    <h3>Completion & Release</h3>
                </div>
                <p><strong>Energy:</strong> Endings, letting go, humanitarianism, transformation</p>
                <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Clearing old patterns, charity, forgiveness, transitions</p>
                <p><strong>Avoid:</strong> Starting major new ventures, holding onto past, isolation</p>
                <p><strong>Mantra:</strong> "I release what no longer serves me"</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="calculation">
            <h2>How to Calculate Your Personal Year</h2>
            <div class="calc-box">
                <p><strong>Formula:</strong> Birth Day + Birth Month + Current Year → Reduce to single digit</p>
                <p><strong>Example for someone born May 15:</strong></p>
                <p>For 2026: 15 + 5 + 2026 = 2046 → 2+0+4+6 = 12 → 1+2 = <strong>3</strong></p>
                <p>Their Personal Year for 2026 is <strong>Year 3</strong> (Creativity & Expression)</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tips">
            <h2>Tips for Working with Personal Years</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Plan Ahead:</strong> Calculate next few years to time major decisions</li>
                <li><strong>Don't Fight the Energy:</strong> Align with the year's theme for ease</li>
                <li><strong>Years 1, 3, 5, 6:</strong> Best for starting new things</li>
                <li><strong>Years 4, 7, 9:</strong> Better for consolidation and inner work</li>
                <li><strong>Year 8:</strong> Harvest time—reap what you've sown in cycle</li>
                <li><strong>Relationships:</strong> Check partner's Personal Year for compatibility timing</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="next-steps">
            <h3>Continue Learning</h3>
            <div class="next-links">
                <a href={`${base}learn/advanced/predictions-guide/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>Next: Predictions Guide →</span>
                </a>
                <a href={`${base}predictions/`} class="next-link">
                    <span>See Your Personal Year →</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <style>
        .breadcrumb { color: #666; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 500; }
        .breadcrumb a { color: #6b3fa0; text-decoration: none; }
        .intro p { color: #444; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        h2 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 30px 0 20px; }
        .cycle-diagram { display: grid; gap: 16px; margin: 20px 0; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .cycle-diagram { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }
        .cycle-phase { border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .cycle-phase.building { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0fdf4, #dcfce7); border: 2px solid #10b981; }
        .cycle-phase.stability { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef9e7, #fef3c7); border: 2px solid #f59e0b; }
        .cycle-phase.completion { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f9f5ff, #f0ebff); border: 2px solid #6b3fa0; }
        .cycle-phase h4 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 800; }
        .cycle-phase p { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .year-card { background: white; border: 2px solid #e8e8e8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .year-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .year-num { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d1b69, #6b3fa0); color: white; width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; }
        .year-header h3 { color: #2d1b69; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; }
        .year-card p { color: #444; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .calc-box { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe, #bae6fd); border: 2px solid #0284c7; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; }
        .calc-box p { color: #444; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .tips ul { color: #444; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 20px; }
        .tips li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .next-steps { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9e5, #ffedd5); border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .next-steps h3 { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .next-links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
        .next-link { background: white; border: 2px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 18px; text-decoration: none; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.2s; text-align: center; }
        .next-link:hover { background: #f59e0b; color: white; transform: translateX(4px); }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .next-links { flex-direction: row; } }
    </style>
</Layout>
